`,o.jsxs(t.p,{children:["MasterStudy LMS versions up to and including 3.7.52 contain an authenticated stored cross-site scripting vulnerability in the administrative Payouts feature. The plugin registered its ",o.jsx(t.code,{children:"stm-payout"})," post type without payout-specific capabilities and did not protect its payout metadata, allowing a contributor-level user to create or modify payout data through WordPress post and metadata interfaces."]}),`
`,o.jsxs(t.p,{children:["The ",o.jsx(t.code,{children:"transaction_id"})," metadata value was passed through ",o.jsx(t.code,{children:"stm_lms_filtered_output()"}),", which applies a filter but does not perform output escaping. The value was then printed directly in both the Payouts list table and the individual payout edit screen. A crafted value therefore executes in the browser of an administrator who views either screen."]}),`
